(0, 114, 0);\">과목 수강신청이 누락되지 않도록 유의하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 114, 0);\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -22.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">※&nbsp;</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2023</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학년도&nbsp;</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">학기 일반대학원 비전일제 학생 이수학점 확대 신청 가능</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -22.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">(4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">페이지&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">일반대학원 비전일제 학생&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">9</span><span sty